This folder contains the scripts to build an overset grid for
the flexible barge used in the research work

"Investigation of ship hydroelasticity" (Ocean Engineering 35 (2008) 523–535)
    by Ivo Senjanović, Šime Malenica and Stipe Tomas̆ević

To generate the grids run the scripts as:

$Overture/bin/rap rap_whole
$Overture/bin/mbuilder hype_whole
$Overture/bin/ogen overlap

To employ surface integration by triangulation, build the patches as:

./build_patches

and put the "patches" folder in your calculation directory.

The grid with "round" corners has been built by Matilde H. Andersen.
